porate Changes & Voting Matters","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0000731766/000119312525143717/d947980d8k.htm"},{"d":"2025-06-13","type":"11-K","title":"Annual report of employee stock purchase","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0000731766/000073176625000171/unh11-kjune2025.htm"},{"d":"2025-06-04","type":"8-K","title":"Corporate Changes & Voting Matters","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0000731766/000073176625000154/unh-20250602.htm"}],"wiki":{"en":{"t":"UnitedHealth Group","x":"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated is an American multinational company based in Eden Prairie, Minnesota, specializing in health insurance and health care services. Selling insurance products under UnitedHealthcare, and health care services under the Optum brand, it is the world's ninth-largest company by revenue and the largest health care company by revenue. The company is ranked fourth on the 2026 Fortune Global 500.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UnitedHealth_Group"},"ru":{"t":"UnitedHealth Group","x":"UnitedHealth Group — крупнейшая компания США в области медицинского страхования, также крупнейшая страховая компания мира по размеру страховых премий. Состоит из двух подразделений: UnitedHealthcare, оказывающего услуги медицинского страхования, и Optum, занимающегося различными услугами в сфере здравоохранения.","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/UnitedHealth_Group"}},"wiki_at":"2026-10-22T15:24:40.267741+00:00"}